---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Open the terminal UI (the default when stdin and stdout are a terminal)

Usage: rustman tui [OPTIONS] [PATH]

Arguments:
  [PATH]
          Directory to open; the workspace is searched for from here upwards (default: the current directory)

Options:
      --theme <NAME>
          Colour theme: dark (default), light or high-contrast; overrides `theme` in tui.toml

      --ascii
          Draw with ASCII characters only (borders, symbols)

      --vim
          Vim keys: hjkl navigation and modal editing; overrides `keymap` in tui.toml

      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
